<%--
Invite_Success_Modal_Body - Success message for user invitation with copyable URL

Modal body component that displays a success message after sending a user invitation,
along with a copyable invitation URL for testing purposes (until email system is implemented).

Arguments:
- $invite_url (string, required): The full invitation URL to display

Usage:
    <Invite_Success_Modal_Body $invite_url="https://example.com/accept-invite?code=abc123" />

Layout:
- Success message with icon
- Label for invitation URL
- Copyable text input with copy button
--%>
<Define:Invite_Success_Modal_Body tag="div">
    <div class="mb-4">
        <div class="d-flex align-items-center mb-3">
            <i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill text-success me-2" style="font-size: 1.5rem;"></i>
            <h5 class="mb-0">Invitation sent!</h5>
        </div>
        <p class="text-muted mb-0">
            The user has been invited to join your organization.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mb-0">
        <label class="form-label fw-bold">Test Invitation URL:</label>
        <Textbox_Click_To_Copy $value="<%= this.args.invite_url %>" />
        <small class="form-text text-muted d-block mt-2">
            Click the input or copy button to copy the invitation URL to clipboard.
        </small>
    </div>
</Define:Invite_Success_Modal_Body>
